# Build/Debug
*.pdb
dist/
*.log

# Node runtime data written by `ferrite run`.
#
# `ferrite init` emits `data_dir = "./data/nodeN"`, which resolves against the
# *process working directory*, so running a node from the repo root drops a live
# Raft log here. The file patterns are a safety net for a data_dir pointed
# somewhere else in the tree: a segment log or a hard-state file is durable
# consensus state and never belongs in version control.
/data/
*.seg
hard_state
